  "published": "2026-02-20T16:08:22.963Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## What's Changed\n### V6.5.0:\n\n* Adds detection for OpenHarmony\n* Discard headers that contain html tags\n* Adds detection for Ace, ArtisBrowser, Doubao, Lemur Browser, Opera Air, Power Browser, Ray and improves detection for Opera GX, Opera Mini\n* Improves version detection for Opera\n* Adds detection for various apps\n* Improves engine detection for Iron Mobile\n* Improves detection for generic bots\n* Detect new brands: G-Tab, SUAAT and Detect devices for exist brands\n* Improves detection for Chrome Mobile iOS\n* Adds detection for Hubot library\n* Adds detection for Hulu and improves version detection for Fire OS\n* Improves version detection for iOS, macOS and Nook Browser\n* Smartisan os\n* Update readme about Cache\n* Detect devices for exist brands\n* Make tests compatible with newer phpunit versions\n* Improve hasUserAgentClientHintsFragment method\n* Improves detection for Java ME\n* Adds detection for Nintendo Browser\n* Adds detection for TeraBox and improves detection for DeepSeek and Google Go\n* add Galaxy Tab S10 Lite\n* Adds detection for Titan OS\n* show 100 unittests in one line\n* Adds detection for Redline\n* Improves version detection for iOS and macOS \n* Update OS versions detect for Pardus, RokuOS, moonOS\n* Improves engine detection for Opera and Edge on iOS\n* Adds detection for Blazer, Clario Browser, Comet and FireSend Browser\n* Improves detection for LG\n* Adds detection for various AI bots\n* Adds detection for various tv brands\n* Adds detection for various bots\n* Improves detection for Avast Secure Browser\n* add some apps\n* rename device maker Jedi to Jide\n* Improves detection for Compaq and adds detection for DEC\n* Improves version detection for Fire OS\n* Move Apache from app to bot (service agent)\n* Adds detection for ArcaOS, Contiki, elementary OS, GhostBSD, Linpus, MINIX, Mocor OS, Plan 9 and improves detection for MAUI Runtime Environment\n* Adds detection for BSD, openSUSE and improves detection for various operating systems\n* Adds detection for WebMoney Advisor\n* Remove Samsung Browser from mobile only\n* Improves detection for Avast Secure Browser\n* change model names for devices\n* Fix detection for Redmi Note 14\n* Improves detection for generic bots\n* Adds detection for ChatGPT and improves detection for iPadOS\n* Adds detection for Orsay and improves detection for Samsung\n* Adds detection for various bots\n* Add ua-extract in readme for python\n* Code changes\n\n### V6.4.8:\n* Adds detection for OpenHarmony\n* Improves detection for Chrome OS from client hints\n* Move HeyTapBrowser to browser\n* feat: add iPhone 17 support\n* Improves version detection for iPadOS, iOS, tvOS and webOS\n* Model changes\n* Adds detection for Cici and improves detection for generic apps\n* Bot corrections + Simbiat Software\n* add model names for samsung tablets\n* Adds detection for various bots\n* add 2 devices, fix devices names\n* change brand names for 2 devices\n* change model names for devices\n* fix: detect brand: Google model: Pixel 7 Pro for instagram app\n* fix: detect os android version for linkedin mobile app\n* Split Honor and Huawe to separately brands\n* Add new regex Chrome Mobile IOS browser and fix wrong detect Chrome WebView for IOS\n* Detect Harmony 360 Browser and add ArkWeb browser engine and Detect devices for exist brands\n* feat(device) detect brand apple: iPad 10 10.9\" WiFi (iPad13,18), iPad 10 10.9\" (iPad13,19)\n* Detect devices for exist brands\n* Detect new brands: AI+, VOIX and Detect devices for exist brands and Detect ChatGPT Atlas browser\n* Detect new bradns: BNCF, Edanix and Detect devieces for exist brands\n* Detect new brands: Genius Devices, Türksat and Detect devices for exist brands\n* Improves version detection for Android and adds detection for Superbalist\n* Improves version detection for Android\n* Fix model list Huawei and Honor brand\n* Add missing iPads detection\n* change model names for devices\n* Adds detection for various bots\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/totpero/DeviceDetector.NET/compare/v6.4.7...v6.5.0",
  "repository": "",
